00:12:01,464 --> 00:12:02,945
[SPEAKER_03]: It's the fourth one.

94
00:12:03,685 --> 00:12:12,867
[SPEAKER_03]: So it's not that, oh, I'm practicing the Noble Eightfold Path in order to come and understand those other Noble Truths and find out what craving is and what the cessation of suffering is.

