116
00:14:51,213 --> 00:14:56,036
[SPEAKER_04]: Like, the craving is 90%, and by doing these things, I'm decreasing it.

117
00:14:56,496 --> 00:15:04,621
[SPEAKER_04]: It's more like, while they are there, walking through that path, craving is not there, but that's why it talks about the underlying tendencies.

118
00:15:05,302 --> 00:15:05,722
[SPEAKER_04]: So, like...

119
00:15:06,302 --> 00:15:13,689
[SPEAKER_04]: During that time that there's right view, right resolve, or right intention, craving is not there, but it can come back.

120
00:15:14,689 --> 00:15:23,617
[SPEAKER_04]: So, as a matter of, like, practicing these things, so to say, for seven years, or five years, or six months, or... by sticking to

121
